  "limits": [
    "Fixed original dense products, shapes, arithmetic and rank ownership only. FP32 is recorded without a priced mode. The 1.8 GHz and simultaneous full Cube capacity are assumptions; they are not a certified hardware rate bound.",
    "Batch totals include only ranks with active target requests and only draft paths feeding the next verification. Each native region is counted once per rank/wave. Capacity takes a maximum across ranks and modes; stage totals are workload counts, not elapsed time.",
    "TTFT uses only the producing prefill on the serving DP, stopping after its target head. No other client queue, previous prefill wave, dummy rank or current-wave draft is compulsory for this estimate. Both endpoint reductions are loose conditional caps, not achievable fusion gains.",
    "The counted subset omits attention internal products, some external auxiliary projections, the FP32 time, memory, synchronization, host work and communications. Changed row counts, reused products or different arithmetic require re-pricing.",
    "For ordinary slot paths the largest archived post-dual B4 kernel time is a shape proxy, not a physical ceiling for all B1–B3 calls. Grant all eligible steps, the larger 26-writer budget and full endpoint transmission. Additional caller/launch or exposed idle savings require distinct evidence. Never add this budget to a whole-caller gain."
  ],
